#: scenario5:scenario5_A1BC6589_AD46_4643_96C3_5BCB407C5728
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fb3453cc2946dea49db90497169b6a52ca25a1ceaf1c71839404e208ce04877
#. default-sha256: 7cad99e56654c607facd77843347cd19a8805e4e980fb9d1418511cbf50d1064
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A1BC6589_AD46_4643_96C3_5BCB407C5728"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If there wasn’t so much fog, I would probably have been able to see little columns of orange "
"evening sunlight fighting their way through the trees,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫S’il n’y avait pas eu autant de brouillard, j’aurais certainement pu voir les petits rayons "
"de lumière orangée du soleil couchant percer à travers les arbres,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_139A6283_5350_4BBB_9D26_9529B5C9F3DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32097d89c08e27e6a0a234bf46ac7228ff8e04dd003ffd69df3251b34c04812e
#. default-sha256: b139fe32b51a1ad80cc878dc8f7944532b856ada65a1967bdfa7ebdca7da056f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_139A6283_5350_4BBB_9D26_9529B5C9F3DE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but the milky white mist seemed to swallow up all the light,⟪k:1⟫leaving nothing for the "
"surrounding area."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫mais on aurait dit que toute la lumière était avalée par la brume blanche et laiteuse, qui "
"ne tolérait rien d’autre sur son passage."

