#: scenario5:scenario5_5DC6471F_7070_4638_9EEE_BF3AF17D1D93
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd599d49c22ecfedc9a04b21c64b425fe2a838a4406882b4fa25a68ca72d8526
