msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5DC6471F_7070_4638_9EEE_BF3AF17D1D93"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I reached my hands out to shut a window—⟪k:1⟫which is when I saw something wavering beyond "
"the heavy mist."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je levai les mains pour fermer une fenêtre—⟪k:1⟫ lorsque je vis quelque chose scintiller par-"
"delà la lourde brume."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7C1C6ED2_E155_4008_80D7_3102732D8B98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecfd27e560f5ad6f1a1e609645c5c367a372f9b8dfa188926cdf33dc05d04533
