msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7D782723_D680_461C_B7EF_27C8E6DAD770"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And it wasn’t just the one. ⟪k:1⟫Looking closer revealed several more flickering spots."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et il n’y en avait pas qu’une. ⟪k:1⟫En regardant plus attentivement, j’aperçus plusieurs "
"points lumineux."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EBD14C51_B28B_4A3F_96F2_FB69E269FEFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43066d26edc9f7a358748c8eb1607c537a7f4ea4bca0c166b39cce5939a006f3
