#: scenario5:scenario5_01832B23_3783_4199_A932_555045568676
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4166bb98b250219db4ce20806562903c3de9bfd197de8a2e8acc04d8e9572b56
